  "label": "Self-deprecating humor",
  "description": "A comedic technique where the speaker makes fun of themselves or their own work, often to deflect criticism or to appear humble. In this meme, the creator is jokingly admitting they are about to share something they consider trivial or uninteresting, using the visual of audience members reacting dramatically to imply the post will be so bad or silly that it's worth the exaggerated reaction.",
